---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy - Real CPS Test" description="Privacy Policy for realcpstest.com">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto space-y-6 py-6">
    <h1 class="text-3xl font-display font-bold text-[#E6EDF3]">Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p class="text-xs font-mono text-[#8B949E]">Last updated: July 2026</p>
    
    <div class="space-y-4 text-sm text-[#8B949E]">
      <p>At <strong>realcpstest.com</strong> (operated under Nodexium), we respect your privacy. This website does not require user registration or personal data collection to use the click speed tester.</p>
      
      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#E6EDF3] pt-2">1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>We do not collect personally identifiable information. Standard web analytics (such as visitor count and browser type) may be aggregated via privacy-friendly analytics tools to improve site performance.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#E6EDF3] pt-2">2. Cookies and Advertising</h2>
      <p>Third-party vendors, including Google AdSense, may use cookies to serve ads based on a user's prior visits to this or other websites. You can opt out of personalized advertising by visiting Google's Ads Settings.</p>

      <h2 class="text-lg font-bold text-[#E6EDF3] pt-2">3. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>If you have any questions regarding this Privacy Policy, you can contact us at <code>nodexium@gmail.com</code>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
